{"t":"AXP","made":"2026-11-25 03:52","name":"American Express Company","ko":null,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Credit Services","employees":76800,"hq":"New York, NY, United States","website":"https://www.americanexpress.com","summary_en":"American Express Company, together with its subsidiaries, operates as an integrated payments company in the United States, Europe, the Middle East and Africa, the Asia Pacific, Australia, New Zealand, Latin America, Canada, the Caribbean, and internationally. It operates through four segments: U.S. Consumer Services, Commercial Services, International Card Services, and Global Merchant and Network Services. The company offers credit and charge cards and complementary products and services, including travel, dining, and lifestyle and expense management products and services; and banking and other payment and financing products and services, including deposits and non-card lending. It also provides merchant acquisition and processing, servicing and settlement, fraud prevention, and point-of-sale marketing and information products and services, as well as network services. The company offers its products and services to consumers, small businesses, mid-sized companies, and large corporations through mobile and online applications, affiliate marketing, customer referral programs, third-party service providers and business partners, in-house sales teams, direct mail, telephone, and direct response advertising. American Express Company was founded in 1850 and is headquartered in New York, New York.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"American Express Company는 자회사와 함께 미국, 유럽, 중동 및 아프리카, 아시아 태평양, 호주, 뉴질랜드, 라틴 아메리카, 캐나다, 카리브해 지역 및 국제적으로 통합 결제 회사로 운영되고 있습니다. 미국 소비자 서비스, 상업 서비스, 국제 카드 서비스, 글로벌 판매자 및 네트워크 서비스 등 4개 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 회사는 여행, 외식, 라이프스타일, 비용 관리 제품 및 서비스를 포함한 신용카드, 신용카드, 보완 제품 및 서비스를 제공합니다. 예금 및 비카드 대출을 포함한 은행 및 기타 지불 및 금융 상품과 서비스. 또한 가맹점 인수 및 처리, 서비스 및 결제, 사기 예방, POS 마케팅, 정보 제품 및 서비스, 네트워크 서비스도 제공합니다. 회사는 모바일 및 온라인 애플리케이션, 제휴 마케팅, 고객 추천 프로그램, 제3자 서비스 제공업체 및 비즈니스 파트너, 사내 영업팀, 다이렉트 메일, 전화 및 직접 반응 광고를 통해 소비자, 중소기업, 중견 기업 및 대기업에 제품과 서비스를 제공합니다. American Express Company는 1850년에 설립되었으며 뉴욕주 뉴욕에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":309.66,"mcap":207643131904.0,"pe":17.445635,"fpe":15.3171835,"peg":1.2474,"ps":2.8502052,"pb":5.80442,"ev_ebitda":null,"div":1.24,"beta":1.077,"hi52":387.49,"lo52":290.97},"fin":{"rev":72851996672.0,"rev_g":0.113,"eps_g":0.309,"gross":0.61954,"op":0.19356,"net":0.16823,"roe":0.35933998,"fcf":null,"cash":43463000064.0,"debt":59986001920.0,"de":167.573,"eps":17.75,"feps":20.21651},"own":{"short":0.0212,"inst":0.64459,"insider":0.22814},"analyst":{"n":24,"mean":364.78708,"median":361.0,"high":425.0,"low":329.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.2069,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":5,"buy":9,"hold":15,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":9,"hold":15,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":6,"buy":9,"hold":14,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":5,"buy":9,"hold":15,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":346.0,"priorPriceTarget":345.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-27","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":335.0,"priorPriceTarget":340.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-26","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":365.0,"priorPriceTarget":360.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-26","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":340.0,"priorPriceTarget":342.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-12","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPr